<section class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl border-t border-gray-200/50 px-6 py-32">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-16 lg:grid-cols-12">
    <!-- Left Column -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <h2
        class="text-heading-32 sm:text-heading-40 text-gray-1000 mb-6 font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight"
      >
        Lowering barriers.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-copy-15 mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
        Student support is most effective when it is immediate. By eliminating the stigma and fear
        of academic or personal consequences, we make it simple for students to seek guidance.
      </p>
      <div class="border-tertiary border-l pl-4 text-xs font-semibold italic text-gray-500">
        "Early peer intervention resolves over 60% of common adjustment difficulties before clinical
        therapy is required."
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column (Typographic Cards with No Borders) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-12 gap-y-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:col-span-7">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-heading-16 text-gray-1000 mb-2 font-bold">Eliminate Stigma</h3>
        <p class="text-label-13 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
          Ask questions, discuss academic pressure, and share struggles without worrying about
          permanent records, labels, or social consequences.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-heading-16 text-gray-1000 mb-2 font-bold">Early Support</h3>
        <p class="text-label-13 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
          Accessible text channels encourage students to find help early in the semester, preventing
          minor issues from escalating.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-heading-16 text-gray-1000 mb-2 font-bold">Candid Discussion</h3>
        <p class="text-label-13 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
          Without identity barriers, student communication is honest, allowing peer mentors to
          provide practical guidance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-heading-16 text-gray-1000 mb-2 font-bold">Mutual Trust</h3>
        <p class="text-label-13 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
          Complete ownership over your participation builds immediate, respectful connections
          between students and mentors.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
